# Master cases

Which verb the Master may press at which status, read while `roles.master.mode` is not `off`. Copy this file to
`roles/master/cases.md` to edit a case; a case your copy lacks is read from here. A press at a status no case names is not
made: it is written to `misses.jsonl` beside `state.json` instead, and the task stops for you. `roles.master.mine` and
`humanPaths` still keep a press yours where a case allows it.

Each case: `move:` a verb the Master presses · `at:` the task's statuses, `any` or `any but <statuses>` ·
`by: master` · one line saying what the case is. A step the Master sends the session is a case `by: master` in
`roles/session/cases.md`.

## ship

move: ship
at: REVIEW_PENDING
by: master
The Master read the hand-back, it holds, and the Master ships it.

## reply

move: reply
at: REVIEW_PENDING
by: master
On the Master's ship the session posts its drafted replies to the reviewers.

## deploy

move: deploy
at: REVIEWED, APPROVED
by: master
The request is green with every thread closed, and the Master deploys it once.

## deploy-finish

move: deploy
at: DEPLOY_CONFLICT
by: master
The session staged a deploy conflict resolved in full, and the Master finishes the deploy you pressed.

## approve-plan

move: approve-plan
at: PLAN_PENDING
by: master
The Master read the plan, it holds, and the Master approves it.

## add-repo

move: add-repo
at: any but DONE
by: master
The session asked for a repository its task lacks, and the Master adds it.

## lift

move: lift
at: any but DONE
by: master
The Master lifts a stop, as asked about a suspected loop or as you would.

## escalate

move: escalate
at: any
by: master
The Master lifts a stop and starts the session again one model tier up.

## trust

move: trust
at: any
by: master
jagt found the repository's config or hooks changed, and the Master adopts them as they are.

## pause

move: pause
at: any but NEW, PLAN_PENDING, DONE
by: master
The Master pauses a started task: nothing of jagt runs on it until the stop is lifted.

## done

move: done
at: any
by: master
The Master closes the task: the session ends, the worktree goes, the branch stays.

## remove-repo

move: remove-repo
at: any but NEW, DEPLOY_CONFLICT, DONE
by: master
The Master takes a repository out of a task that works in several.

## revert

move: revert
at: any
by: master
The Master takes the last deploy back out, as you would.

## sweep

move: sweep
at: any
by: master
The Master reads what the pipeline and the reviewers said and relays it to the session.

## respawn

move: respawn
at: any
by: master
The Master starts a new agent session in the task's worktree.

## focus

move: focus
at: any
by: master
The Master opens the agent's terminal window.

## ide

move: ide
at: any
by: master
The Master opens every worktree of the task in the editor.

## diff

move: diff
at: any
by: master
The Master shows every repository's diff against the branch its request targets.
